    "name": "Last Mage",
    "steam_appid": 2990040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Once, mages shaped the world\u2014until fear turned us into prey. I fled, I hid, but magic leaves a mark. They found me, dragged me from exile, and cast me into the depths.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The whispers here speak of old powers, of horrors never meant to be freed. If I am to survive, I must be precise. Every spell, every artifact, and every choice matters.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Magic still lingers in the dark\u2026 but so does something else.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/235e37a8109907d04c52bb1524ba7382.poster.avif?t=1751977481\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/235e37a8109907d04c52bb1524ba7382.webm?t=1751977481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/bdc7263af3eb952d917727eb09c83cd0.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight your way through the hordes of monsters emerging from the underground.</i> <br><br>Obligated with an almost impossible task, you must <strong>descend into the catacombs</strong> of the desecrated temple to eliminate this calamity. <br><br>Your motivation? Getting your <strong>freedom back</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/60ff4b94e87ba8c64791f9aca4efd8b5.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/bf8ce272e9ea99ae1df4b408a12bce41.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Not only the arrangement of items is crucial, but backpack parts itself as well!</i> <br><br><br><strong>Tailor your backpack</strong> to your strategy, choosing which skills will ensure your survival. <br><strong>Unlock new backpack blocks</strong> and make your inventory even more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/b11b547b74284eada499b47fcbba348d.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/34cc656e83e93e26b6cd8c9f4355e203.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The dungeon is a dangerous place. Luckily, you're also hazardous with a whole arsenal of spells.</i>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your starting rune</strong> and come down to face the monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn experience</strong> with each horror fallen and <strong>pick new spells</strong> as you level up. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just <strong>mind your mana</strong>. You may be powerful, but magic is not an infinite resource.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/44552259a932b82ea139acfe723f45d4.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/416217d3ed9ece2e83ca3663c3fd627f.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some unfortunate souls fell here before you, trying to remedy monster plague. Let's not let their equipment go to waste.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up new items</strong> when you defeat tougher enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test new arrangements</strong> of the items to find the most lethal one; just be careful. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical artifacts tend to <strong>interact with each other</strong> and sometimes create something even more dangerous.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/f945ea93c243eb829f8e31dd2ca8777b.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/85d9bc39db4f87f44b8cc3f7fd259c77.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use experience earned with each descent to <strong>develop your skills</strong> in the skill tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contrary to popular belief, <strong>magic also requires a lot of stamina</strong>. And strength. And speed. And\u2026 You probably get it already.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/0355501504261a0b5c9a60b95a4334c8.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span></p>",
