f stamina</strong>. And strength. And speed. And\u2026 You probably get it already.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990040/extras/0355501504261a0b5c9a60b95a4334c8.avif?t=1751977481\" data-has-big width=800 height=263 /></span></p>",
